</p>

<div class="hero-principle">

<strong>Central idea:</strong>
Intelligence is not the amount of information you possess.
It is your ability to distinguish signals from noise, understand
relationships, identify leverage points, estimate consequences,
and convert uncertainty into better action.

</div>

